# Restart twin for settings_arrangement.scn. Reuse its TURNSTONE_ROOT and start
# a new Turnstone process; `Remove empty Group 1` exists only if the saved group restored.
settle 30
key escape
open mere://alpha
settle 30
act Open Settings pane
settle 10
assert pane turnstone.settings
click surface:settings role:button Edit arrangement
settle 2
capture 01_settings_arrangement_restored
click surface:settings role:button Remove empty Group 1
settle 2
log Settings arrangement group restored
